OL,3,ABalaclava ban comes into force in
OL,4,ANottingham city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ban on face coverings in Nottingham
OL,7,Fcity centre has officially come into
OL,8,Fforce.
OL,10,FFrom today, police and community
OL,11,Fprotection officers will be able to ask
OL,12,Fpeople to remove coverings if they
OL,13,F"reasonably believe" they are being
OL,14,Fused to conceal their identity to
OL,15,Fcommit crime or anti-social behaviour.
OL,17,FAnyone who refuses to comply could face
OL,18,Fa #70 fixed penalty notice or be
OL,19,Fprosecuted, with courts able to impose
OL,20,Fa maximum fine of #1,000.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
