OL,3,ABalaclava ban comes into force in
OL,4,ANottingham city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Nottingham City Council,
OL,7,FNeghat Khan, said residents had felt
OL,8,Fintimidated when they saw people
OL,9,Fwearing balaclavas, skeleton masks or
OL,10,Fother face coverings without a
OL,11,Flegitimate reason.
